In this topic, I will help you remove the Windows activation text and activate it.😊
how to do it?

First, we create a new text document on the desktop. Then, paste the codes I'll provide into this text document.

Codes:

slmgr /ipk W269N-WFGWX-YVC9B-4J6C9-T83GX
slmgr /skms kms8.msguides.com
slmgr /ato
slmgr /xpr    

----------------------------------------
-
-   I'll leave it in the notes folder so you can find your own key.
-
-   The keys listed below are free "timed activation" KMS keys obtained from the Microsoft blog post and moderator comments on the Microsoft forums.
----------------------------------------


However, there's an important point.

In the code above, you need to find your compatible Windows key after the line
"slmgr /ipk W269N-WFGWX-YVC9B-4J6C9-T83GX"    in the code below. I'll give you these.


To find out what version of Windows your computer is, go to "Windows search > This PC > Right click Properties" and find out.

Now that we've learned what we've learned, we can continue. Next, we enter the compatible key after the /ipk in the first line.

Then the process is complete. From the top left, we go to File > Save As.

Important note: The file name isn't important, but the extension is. You need to create a bat file.

Example:
example.Now that we've learned what we've learned, we can continue. Next, we enter the compatible key after the /ipk in the first line.

Then the process is complete. From the top left, we go to File > Save As.

Important note: The file name isn't important, but the extension is. You need to create a bat file.

Example:
example.bat


Our code is ready, our computer is ready. Now, just open the file we saved to your desktop. 

Windows will be activated in 10-15 seconds. Don't forget to star and follow if this was helpful.😊😊
